ck;\">Resist\u00eancia Noturna \u2022 Individual<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">12 Horas Individual<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 23:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 40,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 45,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 60,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 09\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona \u2022 Limite 8h (at\u00e9 03:00)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona Noturna (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 19:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 30,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 35,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 45,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 09\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Resist\u00eancia \u2022 Domingo (Sub-18: 10,00 \u20ac)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">3 Horas Individual (Adultos e Sub-18 acompanhados)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 25,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 09\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Grifo 24h 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Grifo 24h 2026 realiza-se nos dias 14 e 15 de novembro de 2026 no quartel da Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR, situado na Rua Regimento de Engenharia Um (1675-161 Pontinha, Lisboa), num circuito fechado de 2.235,03 metros certificado pela FPA.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada prova do Grifo 24h?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, as provas de 24 Horas (Individual e Equipas de 4) partem \u00e0s 11:00, a Maratona Noturna (42,195 km, limite de 8h) parte \u00e0s 19:00 e as 12 Horas partem \u00e0s 23:00. No domingo, 15 de novembro, a prova de 3 Horas parte \u00e0s 08:00, terminando todas as provas de dura\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 11:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Grifo 24h 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es (limitadas a 400 vagas at\u00e9 08\/11\/2026 em 24hlx.com\/GRIFO24h) dividem-se em 3 fases (at\u00e9 30\/09, de 01\/10 a 31\/10 e de 01\/11 a 09\/11): 24h Individual (50\u20ac \/ 60\u20ac \/ 75\u20ac), 24h Equipa de 4 (135\u20ac \/ 165\u20ac \/ 200\u20ac), 12h Individual (40\u20ac \/ 45\u20ac \/ 60\u20ac), Maratona Noturna (30\u20ac \/ 35\u20ac \/ 45\u20ac) e 3h Individual (15\u20ac \/ 20\u20ac \/ 25\u20ac, ou 10\u20ac fixos para menores de 18 anos acompanhados).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como funciona o servi\u00e7o de refei\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as provas incluem dorsal, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, abastecimento permanente, medalha\/trof\u00e9u de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, local de descanso e banhos. Os atletas das 24h, 12h e Maratona Noturna t\u00eam ainda inclu\u00eddo sopa e bifana (a partir das 15:00 de s\u00e1bado), jantar (18:00 \u00e0s 24:00) e pequeno-almo\u00e7o (05:00 \u00e0s 08:00 de domingo).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Grifo 24h e qual \u00e9 a sua vertente solid\u00e1ria?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR em parceria com o Clube de Praticantes Real Academia \u2013 Atletismo, associando-se \u00e0 iniciativa \u201cTodos os Passos Contam\u201d (Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Galp \/ Rede de Emerg\u00eancia Alimentar) e \u00e0 recolha de bens alimentares n\u00e3o perec\u00edveis para o Banco Alimentar no levantamento do dorsal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grifo 24h 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR, Pontinha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Unidade de Interven\u00e7\u00e3o da GNR e Clube de Praticantes Real Academia \u2013 Atletismo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize